        "gate": {
          "req": "BEAM_FIRE",
          "label": "Fire Beam"
        },
        "child": {
          "text": {
            "value": "The pirate watches as you start to light the meager crops on fire. In a few moments the settlement surrenders, offering tribute to leave them alone. The pirate seems impressed.",
